| prompt tok | TTFT s | prefill tok/s | marginal prefill | decode tok/s | peak decode | server prefill | server decode | out tok |
|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 989 | 0.18 | 5371 (5065–5429) * | - | 76.8 (76.8–76.9) | 78.8 (78.7–79.2) | - | - | 128 |
| 4085 | 0.63 | 6461 (6243–6476) | 6911 | 77.4 (77.1–77.6) | 78.3 (77.9–78.3) | - | - | 128 |
